                <pb facs="0359" n="287" sameAs="frus:frus1882/pg287"/>

                <head>No. 133.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Davis to Mr. Lowell</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-08-11"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 11,
                        1882</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Stephen J. Meany, of New York, a citizen of the United States, is reported as
                    having been arrested at Ennis. Inquire into the case and telegraph the
                    facts.</p>
                <closer><signed>DAVIS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
